meta {
  name: photo-upload-admin
}

vars:pre-request {
  tokenName: another-teest
}

docs {
  Administers the Lightroom publisher's tokens (HOMELAB-139). Select a Bruno environment named sandbox, dev or prod
  first: each holds photoUploadIngressBase and photoUploadAdminKey. The admin key is a secret variable: keep it in
  Bruno's secret store, never in this file. Set tokenName once here: requests 01 and 02 use it. See lego-data-ingress/runbook.md, "Administer Lightroom publisher tokens".
}
